# Password Generator

A simple and interactive Python console application that generates secure passwords containing letters, digits, and special characters based on user-defined length.

## 📌 How It Works

1. Prompts the user for their name and preferred password length.
2. Validates the length (must be at least 8 characters, with dynamic feedback depending on the chosen length).
3. Combines ASCII letters, digits, and punctuation marks into a single character pool using the `string` module.
4. Randomly selects characters to generate a secure password of the specified length.

